OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FDaniel Kinahan is accused of being one
OL,7,Fof Ireland's top organised crime
OL,8,Fbosses, as ITV News' Will Tullis
OL,9,Freports
OL,11,FSuspected organised crime boss Daniel
OL,12,FKinahan woke up in an Irish jail on
OL,13,FMonday after several years of living
OL,14,Fin Dubai.
OL,16,FThe 49-year-old appeared before
OL,17,FDublin's Special Criminal Court on
OL,18,FSunday after he was extradited from
OL,19,Fthe United Arab Emirates.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
