OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FKinahan was flown to Ireland on a
OL,7,FGovernment jet and immediately taken
OL,8,Fby high-speed Garda escort to face
OL,9,Fcharges of directing the activities of
OL,10,Fa criminal organisation between
OL,11,FOctober 18, 2015 and April 6, 2017.
OL,13,FWhen a judge explained to him he could
OL,14,Ffile an application for bail through
OL,15,Fthe High Court, he replied: "I think
OL,16,Fwe all know I won't be getting bail,
OL,17,Fbut thank you for your time."
OL,19,FKinahan, of Dublin, was remanded into
OL,20,Fcustody until October 5.
