OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FHe was told he had the option to
OL,7,Fattend in person or via video link on
OL,8,Fthat date, but said he would decide
OL,9,Flater.
OL,11,FAfter being transferred to the maximum-
OL,12,Fsecurity Portlaoise Prison in the
OL,13,FIrish midlands, Kinahan is likely to
OL,14,Fhave been placed on wing A, which
OL,15,Fhouses some of the most high-profile
OL,16,Finmates.
OL,18,FWho is Daniel Kinahan?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
