OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FDaniel Kinahan has been charged with
OL,7,Fleading the Kinahan cartel, a group
OL,8,Fthe National Crime Agency said has
OL,9,Fbeen linked to more than a dozen
OL,10,Fgangland murders and is responsible
OL,11,Ffor importing tonnes of drugs and
OL,12,Ffirearms around the world.
OL,14,FIs Kinahan wanted by authorities
OL,15,Foutside Ireland?
OL,17,FThe US Treasury Department once
OL,18,Fdescribed the Kinahan group as one of
OL,19,Fthe most dangerous in the world after
OL,20,Fcomparing the clan to Italy's Camorra,
OL,21,FLos Zetas in Mexico and Japan's Yakuza.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
