OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FIts alleged drugs and money laundering
OL,7,Fempire has tentacles that stretch from
OL,8,FBritain to Spain and America.
OL,10,FWashington imposed sanctions on
OL,11,FKinahan in April 2022 after naming
OL,12,Fhim, his father Christopher Snr, and
OL,13,Fbrother Christopher Jnr and other
OL,14,Ffamily members.
OL,16,FThe US government also issued a reward
OL,17,Fof up to five million dollars (4.3
OL,18,Fmillion euro / #3.7 million) for
OL,19,Finformation leading to Kinahan's
OL,20,Farrest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
