OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FWhy does Kinahan have such a fearful
OL,7,Freputation?
OL,9,FThe Kinahan cartel was involved in a
OL,10,Ffeud with the rival Hutch crime gang
OL,11,Fin Ireland, which began in 2015 and
OL,12,Fresulted in 18 deaths.
OL,14,FIn February 2016, an attempt was made
OL,15,Fon Daniel Kinahan's life at a boxing
OL,16,Fweigh-in at the Regency Hotel in
OL,17,FDublin.
OL,19,FOne of his associates, David Byrne,
OL,20,Fwas shot dead, while two others were
OL,21,Finjured.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
