OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FDoes Kinahan have any other business
OL,12,Finterests?
OL,14,FKinahan also had ties to the world of
OL,15,Fsport via defunct boxing management
OL,16,Fcompany MTK Global, which represented
OL,17,Fthe likes of Tyson Fury and Carl
OL,18,FFrampton.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
