OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FHis involvement caused controversy in
OL,7,F2020 when heavyweight Fury thanked him
OL,8,Ffor reaching an agreement for him to
OL,9,Ftake on Anthony Joshua.
OL,11,FFury said Kinahan was responsible for
OL,12,Forganising "the biggest fight in
OL,13,FBritish boxing history".
OL,15,FBut within weeks, Fury's team
OL,16,Fannounced that Kinahan would no longer
OL,17,Fnegotiate for him.
OL,19,FIs Kinahan married?
OL,26,@tD@LOUuD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
