PN,31210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FRobinson had refused to return to
OL,7,FIreland, having even missed her
OL,8,Fmother's funeral in 2020.
OL,10,FWhy has Kinahan returned to Dublin?
OL,12,FKinahan was arrested in the United
OL,13,FArab Emirates on April 15 following a
OL,14,Fbilateral extradition agreement
OL,15,Fbetween Ireland and the UAE.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
