OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FA few days before he was extradited,
OL,7,Fhe told the 'Anything Goes with James
OL,8,FEnglish' podcast: "I reckon I'll be
OL,9,Fhome in the next 48 hours or so, or
OL,10,Fdefinitely by Monday. And it's crazy
OL,11,Fwhen I think of the life where I come
OL,12,Ffrom, where I'm born, everything that
OL,13,FI've been through and going back to
OL,14,FIreland now."
OL,16,FAfter the plane left Dubai on Sunday,
OL,17,Fthe justice ministers for Ireland and
OL,18,Fthe UAE welcomed the extradition in a
OL,19,Fjoint statement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
