OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FJim O'Callaghan and Abdullah bin
OL,7,FSultan bin Awad Al Nuaimi said the
OL,8,FIrish national being extradited was
OL,9,F"regarded as one of the most high-
OL,10,Fprofile individuals sought for
OL,11,Fprosecution in connection with
OL,12,Ftransnational organised crime".
OL,14,FThe two ministers added that the final
OL,15,Fextradition decision "reflects the
OL,16,Fsteadfast commitment of both countries
OL,17,Fto the rule of law and reinforces
OL,18,Finternational judicial co-operation".
