OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FCrowds gathered outside both the
OL,7,FCasement Aerodrome in Baldonnel on the
OL,8,Foutskirts of Dublin on Sunday for the
OL,9,Flanding of the plane, and the Special
OL,10,FCriminal Court, to try to get a
OL,11,Fglimpse of Kinahan.
OL,13,FThey watched two separate high-speed
OL,14,Fconvoys pass by as an additional
OL,15,Fprecaution.
OL,17,FInside the courtroom, the dock was
OL,18,Fchecked by police before Kinahan
OL,19,Fappeared alongside several other
OL,20,Fofficers for a hearing which lasted
OL,21,Fabout 14 minutes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
