PN,31214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FAt the judge-led hearing, Judge Fiona
OL,7,FLydon, Judge Patrick McGrath and Ms
OL,8,FJustice Sarah Berkeley sat in the
OL,9,Fcourt which tries terrorism and
OL,10,Forganised crime cases.
OL,12,FKinahan told the court he had been
OL,13,Fisolated from Friday afternoon, adding
OL,14,Fthat he believed a family member would
OL,15,Fhave contacted a legal representative
OL,16,Fon his behalf, and he was happy to
OL,17,Fproceed.
OL,19,FHe did not react after being charged
OL,20,Fwith directing the activities of a
OL,21,Fcriminal organisation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786447090
OL,3,CWho is suspected crime boss Daniel
OL,4,CKinahan?
OL,6,FDetective Sergeant Colin Davidson told
OL,7,Fthe court that he had arrested Kinahan
OL,8,Fat 6.49pm that day. He said he ensured
OL,9,Fthat the accused understood the charge.
OL,11,FKinahan's lawyers have previously said
OL,12,Fallegations he is a crime boss are
OL,13,Ffalse.
OL,15,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,16,Four political experts are across all
OL,17,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,18,Fto the latest episode below...
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
